<title>PHILIPPINES: Global Equities to build industrial estate.</title>
<headline>Global Equities to build industrial estate.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holding company Global Equities Inc said on Wednesday it had created a new subsidiary to develop an industrial estate in suburban Paranaque municipality.</p>
<p>Global told the Philippine Stock Exchange that Export Parks Commercial Estate Corp will build an export-oriented business park in southern Manila.</p>
<p>Global is engaged in electronics, cotton, cement manufacturing and real estate development.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
